- Contributing/process/build boundaries: [CONTRIBUTING](CONTRIBUTING.md), [policy docs](docs/policy/README.md).

Development work is managed through [alpha S00 tracker #61](https://github.com/boxs-51/Im_player/issues/61) and existing canonical bug issues. No direct production/main merge or release is implied by alpha integration.
